rtex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then depth first, each clique followed by its extensions by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later vertices in ascending index. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating again gives the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d) bitset words per clique for degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/allcliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques","title":"AllCliques","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}